e same is true of the two main sacred caves which survived in the Postpalatial period, Psychro and Ida. Significantly, too, Tyree suggests a diminution in the overall number of Postpalatial sacred caves, from eleven N eopalatial to nine Postpalatial, only eight of which are the same.36 This strongly indicates that the centralized N eopalatial structure of integrated palatial and rural cults had simply ceased to exist” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1328, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 1228})
